        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, have you heard the bombastic news?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Which?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eager Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Croque said the leaders are talking about putting together something new!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, that plan to turn all the lights in the city green? Can't say I'm a fan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eager Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not that one! The one about the slide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard Stitch and Catch are having a huge row over the Great Aquapit's refurbishment plans!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The two of them?! How far are they into their debate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eager Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_574_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uhh, I think now they'll use water cannons to blast people into another cannon, and then into another one... something like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
