    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$holiday_intro",
        "key": "$holiday_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean... I should change how I treat them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you think they're cute?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true that they are nowhere close to what you'd call 'human.' I'm no doctor, but even so, I know that humans are way more complex than the machines we have these days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But that doesn't mean we can't get along with them like friends and family.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Deculture, you're these a 'parent' to these little guys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Parent, huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They count on you and trust you, just like newly hatched fowlbeasts growing under their mothers' wings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the longest time, I've really only seen them in... an indifferent light. All I ever do is what an industrial representative should, the same thing that all the industrial representatives before me did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We pick our robot managers from the Durins who hang out in the robotics section of the library. We have to master how to create these little things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not actually that complicated. All we have to do is follow the books' instructions and put together the parts that we like... use our imaginations, and they always work without fail.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My teacher spent years trying to figure out the logic behind them, but he came up empty-handed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From what I heard, my teacher's teacher also researched it, and it's thanks to her that the assistant robots can tell jokes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know how to make a Durin angry? Nobody knows! Hahaha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, that's amazing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for me, all I'm doing is taking their abilities for granted. You're right. I should try to actually get along with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "0429, your fellow robot 0428 has been retired. Inspection will not reawaken it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that doesn't change that it was one of us. The things that it built will last.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Retirement isn't the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Instruction acknowledged. Retirement is not the end. Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Relationship defined with Zumama: friend. Deculture, I would like us to be defined as friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Friends. Right, friends. We can get along like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "0429, did you know? Friends are supposed to help each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before, I used to order you to do everything that I couldn't be bothered to handle myself...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now I'm thinking that's not how this should be. We should be on equal footing with one another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From here on out, I will ask you to help me with my tasks, as a friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Acknowledged. Help friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "0429, please\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Send three cases of ale to my place, and bring some snacks while you are at it. After that, please let Master Edge know that I won't be attending today's representative meeting because I'll be sleeping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That doesn't seem quite right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_572_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Gavial, you're here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my new friend, Assistant Robot #0429, and its terrible boss, Deculture.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Deculture, meeting invitation, all representatives\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_569_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "0429, change of plans. As your friend, I'm asking you to do me this favor. Go to that meeting for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Deculture Silvermint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_576_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Help friend. Help friend!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Strange Machine #0429"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Do it yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
