    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$dontmaketrouble_intro",
        "key": "$dontmaketrouble_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's the end of the voting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, then. Per consensus, this is it for the Great Aquapit, and we will repair the railroad bridge and build a new landmark for Zeruertza at the same time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hell yeah! I've been getting tired of the slide anyway!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheering Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The new plan better be something totally different! I heard we're getting a roller coaster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Imaginative Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Water coaster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheering Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looping water coaster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Imaginative Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A catapult looping water coaster! With a super water cannon! And a racetrack for self-driving carts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheering Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_567_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stitch and I will each submit an independent design proposal, and we'll call another meeting to decide which proposal to move forward with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Catch Lightrace"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Stitch? Stitch who lives in the cube?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheering Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, I saw a design of his a few years ago... It wasn't much fun, but it had a unique sense of beauty...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Imaginative Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we can come up with some new way to have fun there. I mean, that place is pretty much an open space, and the important thing is what we can do with it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheering Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It kind of feels like Stitch's building would be a good place to lie down and relax\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Imaginative Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like that super relaxing Gaulish meditation I saw in 'Stranger Things!'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cheering Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_573_1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_575_1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, I think I can work with that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Imaginative Durin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew, looks like everything went off without a hitch? Not that we actually did anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we did see a hard, bitter negotiation play out. Isn't that right, Croque?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_566_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Edge! Drink up, old man! What, are you keeping fins in your cup?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croque Diamondface"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_564_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*! I'm trying to take a short break!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Edge Eartheart"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_572_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've done a lot, Gavial! We went shopping and bought a lot of stuff and had a decent vacation. Plus, we even helped score a huge project for Acahualla!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4055_bgsnow_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you also made a mess of my feelings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Avdotya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't say that. I thought we made friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it went much more smoothly than I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That just goes to show that you could've done it yourself, you punk.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, what's next...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1026_gvial2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a funny look on your face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a while since I've worked on anything, so I'm feeling a little...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... It's okay. I just have to warm up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4054_malist_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once I get myself back into the game, surely\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stitch Canvas"
    },
